+      <p class="ew-kicker">Open-web handoff</p>
+      <h2>${escapeHtml(new URL(url).hostname.replace(/^www\./i, ''))}</h2>
+      <p>${escapeHtml(reason)} EON Workstation keeps your AI plan, notes, approval log, and source reader here while the external site opens in a real browser tab.</p>
+      <div class="ew-external-url">${escapeHtml(url)}</div>
+      <div class="ew-external-actions">
+        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="ew-open-external-now">Open external tab</button>
+        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" id="ew-read-external-now">Read with EON source reader</button>
+        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" id="ew-copy-external-now">Copy URL</button>
+      </div>
+      <ul class="ew-trust-list">
+        <li>No fake iframe promise: Google, banks, social sites, and many SaaS apps block embedding.</li>
+        <li>Submit, login, payment, wallet, and delete actions still require explicit user approval.</li>
+        <li>Use EONBOT for planning/extraction, then finish sensitive actions yourself in the external tab.</li>
+      </ul>
